flowchart LR
 U[User] --> MIC[Microphone]
 MIC --> STT[Speech input / STT]
 STT --> N[Text normalizer]
 N --> R[Command router]
 R --> S[Allow-listed skills]
 S --> OUT[Response builder]
 OUT --> TTS[Windows SAPI]
 OUT --> CON[Console output]
 S <--> STORE[Local notes / preferences]
 CFG[Configuration] --> R
 TESTS[Unit and integration tests] -. validate .-> N
 TESTS -. validate .-> R
 AI[Future Level 2 AI adapter] -. optional .-> R
